<anchor xml:id="_class_assimp_1_1_exporter_1a8200b618c21c272c839c37060a871d48"/><section>
    <title>FreeBlob()</title>
<indexterm><primary>FreeBlob</primary><secondary>Assimp::Exporter</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>Assimp::Exporter</primary><secondary>FreeBlob</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput><link linkend="_d3dcommon_8h_1a7c519f1a5c88707e509aba3a18925f3a">void</link> Assimp::Exporter::FreeBlob ( )</computeroutput></para>
<para>Frees the current blob.</para>

<para>The function does nothing if no blob has previously been previously produced via <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_exporter_1a7277886036ad226658c10365ba37df18">ExportToBlob</link>. <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_exporter_1a8200b618c21c272c839c37060a871d48">FreeBlob</link> is called automatically by the destructor. The only reason to call it manually would be to reclaim as much storage as possible without giving up the <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_exporter_1ac45a55fc178256576d2d21b58bd944a0">Exporter</link> instance yet. </para>
</section>
<anchor xml:id="_class_assimp_1_1_exporter_1a5decf63339305b6bf5dab240950af22b"/><section>
